(101, '3C — Stress & Pressure Response', 'Your typical stress response in interpersonal conflicts is:', 'Forced Choice', '[{"label": "A", "text": "Withdrawal and silence."}, {"label": "B", "text": "Direct confrontation."}, {"label": "C", "text": "Seeking mediation."}, {"label": "D", "text": "Humor to defuse tension."}, {"label": "E", "text": "Emotional expression."}]'::jsonb, '["Stress Management", "Emotional Stability"]'::jsonb, 1.0),
