(106, '3D — Persistence & Grit', 'You have been working toward a goal for 18 months with minimal progress. You:', 'Forced Choice', '[{"label": "A", "text": "Persist \u2014 results take time."}, {"label": "B", "text": "Fundamentally reassess the approach."}, {"label": "C", "text": "Set a clear deadline to evaluate and potentially pivot."}, {"label": "D", "text": "Seek external perspective on whether to continue."}]'::jsonb, '["Persistence"]'::jsonb, 1.0),
