(131, '4C — Networking & Social Energy', 'After an intensive day of social interaction (meetings, events), you feel:', 'Forced Choice', '[{"label": "A", "text": "Energized and want more."}, {"label": "B", "text": "Neutral \u2014 it does not significantly affect my energy."}, {"label": "C", "text": "Somewhat drained."}, {"label": "D", "text": "Significantly depleted."}]'::jsonb, '["Networking", "Social Energy"]'::jsonb, 1.0),
