(151, '5A — Core Motivational Drivers', 'Rank these motivational drivers from most to least important to you:', 'Ranking', '[{"label": "A", "text": "Achievement and mastery."}, {"label": "B", "text": "Recognition and status."}, {"label": "C", "text": "Security and stability."}, {"label": "D", "text": "Purpose and meaning."}, {"label": "E", "text": "Learning and growth."}, {"label": "F", "text": "Wealth and financial freedom."}, {"label": "G", "text": "Relationships and belonging."}]'::jsonb, '["Achievement Drive", "Recognition Need"]'::jsonb, 1.0),
