(214, '6D — Cross-Functional & Cross-Cultural Adaptability', 'When cultural norms at work differ from your personal values, you:', 'Forced Choice', '[{"label": "A", "text": "Adapt to the cultural norms."}, {"label": "B", "text": "Maintain my own approach."}, {"label": "C", "text": "Find a synthesis that respects both."}, {"label": "D", "text": "It depends on the degree of conflict."}]'::jsonb, '["Flexibility", "Learning Agility"]'::jsonb, 1.0),
